{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14107270","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14107270","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1410727001:0":{"text":"陛下！インドラ隊長はドワーフや異族のメイジと結託し、神聖なる霊水の秘密を知ったのですよ。","source_cn":"陛下！因度厄卫队长勾结矮人和异族魔法师，窥探到了恩典灵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE50989E3B2A1A0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410727002:0":{"text":"これはサロクディアの存立を脅かす行為です。どうか、彼らに公正な裁きを……","source_cn":"他的所作所为已经严重威胁萨洛克兰的根基，恳请您降下公正...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB734A13D1F5470BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410727003:0":{"text":"インドラ、そして異郷より来たる客人よ。今この場で口にした言葉が、そなたらの運命を左右すると心せよ。","source_cn":"说说吧，因度厄，还有两位来自异族的访客。此刻，为自己辩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E72DA66AA636A1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410727004:0":{"text":"陛下……そのお姿は、一体……？","source_cn":"女王陛下……您这副样貌究竟是……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDA0E6F3F7A14845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410727005:0":{"text":"インドラ！陛下になんという無礼な質問を！","source_cn":"因度厄，你怎敢向陛下提出如此失礼的问题！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x674E6503DC58AE83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":""