ent_title_status":""},"say:31:1410727018:0":{"text":"ふん、地上がどんな場所か、インドラが実際に見に行けば分かることだろ！","source_cn":"哼，地面到底是什么样子，等因度厄自己去看看就知道了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2C38CB0F07294D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1410727019:0":{"text":"エクシルの女王様よ！オレらの先祖はなぜか竜に呪われたが、アンタらは一体何をして神を怒らせたんだ？","source_cn":"艾塞勒的女王！我的祖先们触怒了龙，因此遭到诅咒，你们又...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA68E4BBE299FA1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1410727020:0":{"text":"ふっ、神は計り知れぬもの。我らは、故郷を守りたかっただけだ……","source_cn":"呵，神明，不可捉摸。我们也只是为了保卫生存的家园……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA76EB60142FCE095","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1410727021:0":{"text":"とにかく、ミサタの呪いに抵抗できるのは原初の竜の力のみ。我らに選択の余地などなかったのだ。","source_cn":"总之，只有利用初始之龙的力量，才能对抗弥萨忒的诅咒，那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C5C07B649BA5C01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1410727022:0":{"text":"ですが、卵白の摂取をやめれば怪物になってしまう……それも、一種の呪いではないのですか……！","source_cn":"可是一旦停止饮用龙的蛋清，我们便会异化成可怕的怪物，这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA28B4E2FA86D93BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1410727023:0":{"text":"なぜやめる？原初の竜は眠っている間も卵を産み落とし続ける。実に不思議な生き物よ。","source_cn":"为什么要停止呢？初始之龙即便在沉睡时也会不断地产下子嗣...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73B75A826B6EFFD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1410727024:0":{"text":"我らが恵の霊水を飲み続ける限り、そなたの言う怪物になることはない。","source_cn":"只要我们继续饮用恩典灵露，没人会变成你所畏惧的怪物。不是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2286D7E3D87E8194","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1410727025:0":{"text":"オルムエッグはいくらでも手に入る。これぞまさしく、地底の贈り物、エスペリアが我らに与えし生命の光だ。","source_cn":"龙蛋取之不尽，用之不竭，这是地下的馈赠，是伊索米亚给予...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEACED61A089C5C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1410727026:0":{"text":"贈り物には代償がつきものだ。その体が証拠だろ。","source_cn":"任何馈赠都有代价，你这副身体是最好的证据。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0B0A91B2545C95C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1410727027:1":{"text":"毎日毎日、卵白を水の代わりに飲んでたから、そんな姿になったんじゃないのか？","source_cn":"就算你天天把龙的蛋清当水喝，还不是变成了这副可怕的模样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDE8520307589E70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:141